<div style="padding: 30px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">
    <!-- Heading -->
    <h1 style="font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 20px;">
        Complete Your Profile
    </h1>

    <!-- Greeting -->
    <p style="font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 10px;">
        Hello Dr. <strong>{{fullName}}</strong>,
    </p>

    <!-- Intro -->
    <p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 20px;">
        Thank you for registering on <strong>CosmicForge HealthNet</strong> — we’re excited to have you join our 
        growing community of medical professionals transforming healthcare access across Nigeria and Africa.
    </p>

    <!-- Main message -->
    <p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 20px;">
        We noticed your profile is not yet complete. Completing your profile helps you:
    </p>

    <!-- Benefits -->
    <ul style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 20px; padding-left: 20px;">
        <li>✅ Build trust with patients seeking your expertise</li>
        <li>✅ Get verified on our platform</li>
        <li>✅ Start receiving consultations and earning from telemedicine</li>
    </ul>

    <p style="font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 30px;">
        It only takes <strong>3–5 minutes</strong> to finish, and you’ll be all set to start offering care to patients nationwide.
    </p>

    <!-- Button -->
    <div style="text-align: center; margin: 30px 0;">
        {{ button url=profileSetupLink text="Complete My Profile Now" }}
    </div>

    <!-- Help section -->
    <div style="background-color: #F5F8FF; border-left: 4px solid #3964EA; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px; margin: 20px 0;">
        <p style="font-size: 14px; margin: 0; color: #4b5563;">
            <strong>Need help?</strong> Our support team is always ready to guide you. Visit our 
            <a href="{{supportLink}}" style="color: #3964EA; text-decoration: none;">support center</a>, 
            reply to this email, or reach us via 
            <a href="mailto:cosmicforgehealth@gmail.com" style="color: #3964EA; text-decoration: none;">cosmicforgehealth@gmail.com</a> 
            or WhatsApp at <a href="https://wa.me/2347031455395" style="color: #3964EA; text-decoration: none;">+234 703 145 5395</a>.
        </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Sign off -->
    <p style="margin-top: 30px; font-size: 14px;">
        We look forward to seeing you fully onboarded and impacting lives with us.<br><br>
        Warm regards,<br>
        <strong>The CosmicForge HealthNet Team</strong>
    </p>
</div>
